Subject: Declare callee exits by exact entry width

Add exit_mx_for to both cfg parsers and analyzers. Keep explicit facts
separate from inferred routes and preserve them across regeneration.
Test exact callers, mirrors, override scope, refresh and cache invalidation.

Co-authored-by: Codex <codex@openai.com>

